			"notes": "# Update v1.4\n\n## Additions\n### Blocks\n#### Nether Spores\n- They fall slowly when put under enough pressure.\n- Crafted with 1 wart or shroomlight in the Quartz Shredder, yielding 1 or 6 respectively.\n#### Icicle\n- Similar function to pointed dripstone, but can fall automatically when an entity is underneath.\n- Grows under ice that has water above it."
		},
