			"notes": "# Update v1.2\n\n## Additions\n### Blocks\n#### Rainbow Eucalyptus wood set\n- Comes from a beautiful tree with rainbow bark and black wood.\n- Grows in jungles.\n- Yes, it's real. Minus the black wood.\n### Items\n#### Rainbow Sawdust\n- A perfect on-the-go snack that gives Luck, Haste, and Saturation for a minute. Yeah, it might be a bit unbalanced.\n- Created by shredding a rainbow eucalyptus log or wood.\n- Feed it to a Sniffer for something crazy.\n#### Animal Feed\n- Can tempt and be fed to any animal that breeds with wheat, wheat seeds, or carrots.\n- Crafted by shredding wheat, wheat seeds, and a carrot.\n## Changes\n- Gave rubber wood and rainbow eucalyptus wood new sound effects."
		},
