			"notes": "# Update v1.1\n\n## Additions\n### Blocks\n#### Advanced Note Block\n- Has a higher pitch range than normal note blocks.\n- You can change its octave by sneaking and right clicking with an empty hand.\n- Crafted with 8 note blocks and 1 quartz, making 8.\n#### Quartz Shredder\n- Can shred items on top of it when right clicked to create an output item.\n- Crafted with 8 cobblestone around 1 quartz.\n#### Steel Wool\n- Can be burnt to give it a darker color and higher blast resistance.\n- Sets the advanced note block's instrument to an electric guitar.\n  - The burnt version uses a power chord.\n- Crafted in the quartz shredder by shredding 1 iron ingot.\n### Items\n#### Stripes Armor Trim\n- Gives all armor a striped appearance, with the chestplate having a zipper. (This references nobody in particular.)\n- Can be found in small ocean ruin chests.\n## Fixes\n- Rubber wood was not flammable.\n- The spike block had to be powered after it was placed."
